-- Playbook database-correction.annual-invoice-cancellation 1.0.0; shared PBR01..06/PAR01..07 apply.
-- Canonical guide: ../../invoice-receipt-correction/references/sql-contracts.md
-- Domain context: Annual payment (recurring_type_4 / ชำระแบบรายปี).
-- Generate complete original-row standby DML recovery from the immutable pre-mutation JSON backup snapshot.
--
-- Annual payment recovery invariants:
-- 1. Restore all deleted charge transactions in public.garbage_fee_transaction (up to 12 monthly rows) with original full columns/nulls/timestamps.
-- 2. Restore exclusive QR in public.garbage_fee_qrcode with original QR payload, barcode, satang token, and bank references.
-- 3. Restore all mapping rows in public.garbage_fee_qrcode_transaction linking the restored QR to the restored transactions.
-- 4. Restore the annual invoice in public.garbage_fee_invoice with original invoice_id, number, status, amount, and dates.
-- 5. Guard database/SID/entity and bind exact committed after-state hashes; reject PK/reference conflicts or newly arrived payments.
-- 6. Assert restored counts match exactly and the full original collection/balance state is re-established.
-- 7. Default to ROLLBACK;. Live restore requires separate explicit human authorization.
BEGIN;
DO $authoring_only$ BEGIN
  RAISE EXCEPTION 'AUTHORING_TEMPLATE_ONLY: author full annual invoice, fiscal-year transactions, and QR/mapping recovery and bind actual committed after-state';
END $authoring_only$;
ROLLBACK;
